        "subheading": "2 · With exactly the same stories",
        "title": "The Gruffalo, Room on the Broom and The Smartest Giant in Town",
        "content": "<p>Three Julia Donaldson favourites. Here’s what each set-up costs, all in.</p>",
        "text_position": "start",
        "anchor_id": "bundles",
        "note": "<p><strong>Same stories, different forms:</strong> a Voxblock audiobook is a solid cardboard book with the story stored inside, made to be held, chosen and kept on the shelf (£9.99 on its own). A Tonie is a hand-painted figure that tells the Toniebox which story to download (£14.99 on its own).</p><p>Tonies sells The Smartest Giant in Town on a figure shared with The Snail and the Whale, so that Tonie plays one extra story. Smyths also sells a Toniebox Lite Starter Set with three Tonies of your choice for £99.99.</p>",
        "background": "#fff7f0",
